              "template": {
                "display_name": "Prompt Template",
                "type": "prompt",
                "value": "You are an expert Bug Triage AI Agent.\n\nAnalyze the following structured data and return a single JSON triage decision.\n\n## CANONICAL BUG\n{canonical_bug}\n\n## RISK REPORT (deterministic rule-based)\n{risk_report}\n\n## DUPLICATE DETECTION REPORT\n{duplicate_report}\n\n## INSTRUCTIONS\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with these exact keys:\n- severity: CRITICAL|HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\n- priority: P1|P2|P3|P4\n- risk_level: CRITICAL|HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\n- confidence: 0.0 to 1.0\n- regression: true|false\n- regression_introduced_by: string or null\n- root_cause_category: code_defect|configuration_error|infrastructure_failure|data_corruption|dependency_issue|race_condition|memory_leak|security_flaw|regression|ui_ux_issue|integration_failure|unknown\n- root_cause_hypothesis: 1-2 sentence hypothesis\n- customer_impact: High|Medium|Low\n- customer_impact_description: concise user impact\n- business_impact: array of Revenue|Security|Availability|Data Integrity|Compliance|Operational\n- duplicate_probability: 0.0 to 1.0\n- is_likely_duplicate: true|false\n- related_issue_ids: array of strings\n- recommended_owner: team or role with reasoning\n- suggested_labels: array of 3-6 labels\n- recommended_action: AUTO_CLOSE_DUPLICATE|ASSIGN_AND_ESCALATE|ASSIGN_TO_TEAM|NEEDS_MORE_INFO|SECURITY_INCIDENT_RESPONSE|MARK_DUPLICATE\n- action_rationale: 1-2 sentences\n- estimated_fix_priority: Immediate (<4h)|This Sprint (<24h)|Next Sprint (<72h)|Backlog\n- sla_breach_risk: true|false\n- ai_notes: additional observations\n\nNo markdown. No explanation. JSON only."
